The story mode
The story mode is designed to test your fighting skills, as well as to make you quickly think on your feet and perform an action to save yourself.
There are a total of five quests, each one different from the other in one form or another. At the end of each quest you get a reward, as well as a token which insures your completion of the quest goes smoothly.
Without completing a previous quest you cannot complete the next one. For example, a person who has not completed the first quest will not be able to complete the second one, because he will not be allowed to do so.
Each quest can be only completed once.
The major maps of the quests are the library, the unseelers base, the abandoned factory, the magical forest, and the tower, not the burnt one of course!
Major rewards. Wand, aura, sealed key.
Location. Can be accessed through safe zone by pressing shift enter on the story mode